---
import { t } from '../../i18n/ui';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const LOCALE = 'en' as const;
const strings = t(LOCALE);
---
<Layout
  locale={LOCALE}
  title={`${strings.privacy} — Blog`}
  description="Privacy policy for bilisimpostasi.com.tr — how we collect and process personal data."
>
  <main class="static-page legal-page">
    <h1>{strings.privacy}</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 17 August 2026</p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how personal data of visitors to bilisimpostasi.com.tr (the “Site”)
      is processed by Ömer Faruk Türegün, the owner and operator of the content published on the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Controller</h2>
    <p>
      Ömer Faruk Türegün (individual) — Email:
      <a href="mailto:trkuraf@gmail.com">trkuraf@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      The Site does not collect personal data from visitors except in the following circumstances:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Usage statistics:</strong> Anonymous visit statistics are collected via a self-hosted
        Umami instance. The Site does not use cookies for this purpose.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Newsletter and notifications:</strong> If you subscribe, your email address or Telegram
        user information is collected solely so that we can notify you about new articles. This is done
        only with your explicit consent. We do not use this information for any other purpose and do not
        share it with third parties.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>The Site does not use cookies for user tracking or profiling.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Anthropic Claude is used to generate article summaries (visitor data is not sent to Claude for
      this purpose). Newsletter emails are delivered via Resend; Telegram notifications are sent through
      Telegram’s infrastructure.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under applicable data protection law, including the Turkish Personal Data Protection Law (KVKK,
      Law No. 6698) where it applies, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your
      personal data by contacting
      <a href="mailto:trkuraf@gmail.com">trkuraf@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated from time to time. The current version will always be published on
      this page.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .static-page { max-width: 42rem; }
  .legal-page .updated { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .legal-page h2 { margin-top: 1.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .legal-page p, .legal-page li { line-height: 1.65; }
  .legal-page ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .legal-page li { margin-bottom: 0.65rem; }
</style>
